				"Nerfed Enchants: Blazing, Shocking, Grim, Vampiric\n\n" +
				"Removed Enchants: Vorpal, Venomous, Dazzling, Eldritch, and Stunning.\n\n" +
				"New Enchants: Blocking, Blooming, Elastic (formerly a curse), Precise, and Swift.\n\n" +
